    <title type='text'>The Evolution of Autonomous Agents</title>
    <content type='html'>&lt;h2&gt;Introduction to Agentic Architectures&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Autonomous agents have progressed dramatically over the past two years. We are witnessing a shift from static prompt completion to &lt;strong&gt;dynamic multi-step reasoning&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key breakthroughs include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Recursive decomposition of complex user requests&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Autonomous tool execution and self-correction loops&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Persistent memory across conversation epochs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;The true power of AI is not in single-token prediction, but in the orchestrated execution of intent.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For further details, visit &lt;a href="https://example.com/whitepaper"&gt;the research paper&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
