    <title type='text'>Hardware Benchmarks: GPU vs TPU Performance</title>
    <content type='html'>&lt;h3&gt;Watch the Benchmark Walkthrough&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here is the live benchmark recording:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ" title="Benchmark Video" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Standard Results Table&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
  &lt;thead&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;
      &lt;th&gt;Device&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;th&gt;Throughput (tokens/s)&lt;/th&gt;
      &lt;th&gt;Latency (ms)&lt;/th&gt;
    &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/thead&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;
      &lt;td&gt;NVIDIA H100&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;td&gt;3,450&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;td&gt;12.4&lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;
      &lt;td&gt;Google TPU v5e&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;td&gt;3,120&lt;/td&gt;
      &lt;td&gt;14.1&lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Complex Partitioning Table (With Colspan)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Below is a partitioned cluster breakdown:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border="1" cellpadding="5"&gt;
  &lt;tr&gt;
    &lt;th colspan="2"&gt;Cluster Tier Alpha&lt;/th&gt;
    &lt;th&gt;Cost per Hour&lt;/th&gt;
  &lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;tr&gt;
    &lt;td&gt;Node A&lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;td&gt;Node B&lt;/td&gt;
    &lt;td&gt;$18.50&lt;/td&gt;
  &lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benchmark Script&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;pre class="brush: python"&gt;&lt;code&gt;def calculate_throughput(tokens, elapsed_seconds):
    return tokens / elapsed_seconds
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chemical stability factor: H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O and efficiency factor: O(N&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;</content>
    <link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='https://tech-analysis.blogspot.com/2025/07/hardware-benchmarks-gpu-vs-tpu.html' title='Hardware Benchmarks: GPU vs TPU Performance'/>
